  "description": "Return a single row with ride_count (the total number of rides), total_revenue (the sum of fare plus tip for every ride, treating a missing fare or missing tip as 0), and best_tip (the largest tip of any ride). Rides with a NULL tip must not be counted as a zero when finding the largest tip.",
