  "solutionQuery": "SELECT COUNT(*) AS ride_count, ROUND(SUM(COALESCE(fare, 0) + COALESCE(tip, 0)), 2) AS total_revenue, MAX(tip) AS best_tip FROM Rides",
  "explanation": "COUNT(*) counts every ride regardless of NULLs, while COALESCE replaces missing fares and tips with 0 before they are added and summed so NULL rows still contribute their known part. MAX(tip) ignores NULL tips automatically, which is why ride id 4 with a 5.0 tip wins. The result is one row.",
